@startuml
title RPRRSBSI-V5 DDL Authoring and Marketplace Bolt-on Submission (Opus5_5, 2026-11-05)
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
|Developer|
start
:Enter DDL Authoring mode (capability DdlAuthoring);
:Define tables as data (AceDdl.*Definition) in an EditSession;
|DDL Authoring service|
:Validate (types, names, PK, owner columns, FK scope, quotas);
:Generate and apply CREATE/ALTER in AceDev_<user>;
:Record materialization + DDL SHA-256 (outside Flyway);
|Developer|
:Enter seed and working data (owner-only);
:Submit bolt-on (capability MarketplaceDeveloper);
:Select template rows (default none);
|Automated checks|
:Scan template rows (PII, secrets, closure, licence);
:Lint, collision check, disposable rehearsal;
|Reviewer + ATAP maintainer|
:Approve content, licence, data; approve ATAPUtilities change;
|Release|
:Generate forward Flyway migration\n(ATAPUtilities tables + template rows + Ace twins + RLS);
:Promote package through five tiers;
|Data move (runtime)|
:Verified backup of developer tables;
:Copy private rows into Ace twins (owner = developer);
:Verify counts and hashes; record Generated instantiations;
:Retire and drop developer tables; BoltOnPromotionReceipt;
|Marketplace|
:Publish MarketplaceOffering, Plan, Price;
:Buyer purchase -> Entitlement -> BoltOnActivation (buyer-owned rows);
stop
@enduml
